                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "locked": false,
                  "text": "<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top:18px;\"><strong style=\"color:#334155; font-size:13px;\">Important Preparation Guidelines:</strong><ul style=\"margin:8px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\"><li style=\"line-height:22px;\">Ensure a stable internet connection and test your camera & microphone in advance.</li><li style=\"line-height:22px;\">Join from a quiet environment with proper lighting.</li><li style=\"line-height:22px;\">Be ready with any portfolio, GitHub links, or projects you wish to discuss.</li><li style=\"line-height:22px;\">Join the WhatsApp group immediately for real-time queue notifications and schedule coordination.</li><li style=\"line-height:22px;\">Late arrivals will not be accommodated. (If you are unable to attend your slot, please contact the organizers in advance via the WhatsApp group).</li></ul></div>"
